      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "23",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ya ulemwa wa acakongwe ŵaŵili",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AMBUJE",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ŵaŵecete ni une. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“M'mwe mwanace jwa mundu, ŵatite, paliji pana acakongwe ŵaŵili ŵacitumbo cimo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵatendaga ya lilamayo ku Iguputo, yalilama ŵatendaga ali ŵali, kweleko ŵagambaga kwakamula maŵele gawo gangagwa gala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jwamkulungwa ŵaliji Ohola, mpwakwe ŵaliji Oholiba. Nalombile wosope ŵanaŵaŵili mwamti ŵamŵelecele ŵanace ŵacalume ni ŵacakongwe. Mena gawo gakwete ngopolelo, Ohola lyagopolelaga Samaliya ni Oholiba lyagopolelaga Yelusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ohola ŵatendaga yalilama atamose kuti ŵaliji ŵa une. Ŵapitilisyaga kutenda ya lilama ni maganja gakwe ga ku Asiliya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Acalumewo, ŵane ŵaliji asilikali ŵakulwala ya papo, ŵaliji ŵa bwanamkubwa, ŵane ŵaliji ŵakulongolela ngondo, wosope ŵaliji ŵakusalala soni ŵakwela mahaci. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ohola ŵatendaga lilama ni wosopewo, acalume ŵakupikanika ŵa ku Asiliya. Soni ŵalisakesye ni milungu jine ja acalume wosope uŵatendaga nawo yalilamayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nganaleka ndamo syakwe syakusala syalilama siŵatendaga ku Iguputo, kwele acalume ŵakwe ŵagonaga najo ali mwali. Ŵamkamulaga maŵele gakwe ni gonaga najo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo nampelece kwa maganja gakwe ga ku Asiliya, gele jwalakwe ŵaganonyelaga mnope. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jemanjajo ŵamwusile yakuwala, ni ŵamsumwile ŵanace ŵakwe ŵacalume ni ŵacakongwe, ni kwawulaga ni upanga. Acakongwe ŵaŵecetaga kulikose ya jwalakwe mwele muŵapocelele cilango cakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Atamose kuti mpwawo Oholiba ŵayiweni yeleyi, jwalakwe jwatesile ya lilama kumpunda muŵatendelaga Ohola mkulugwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nombe najo ŵanonyelaga Asiliya, mnopemnope acibwanamkubwa, acakulungwa ŵa ngondo, asilikali ŵa inifolomu, ŵakwela mahaci, wosopewo ŵaliji acacanda ŵakusalala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Soni nayiweni kuti jwalakwe ŵalisakesye, myoyo ŵaŵiliwo ŵakuyisye litala limo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nambo Oholiba jula jwatesile ya lilama mwakupundanganya mnope. Ŵayiweni yitusitusi ya acalume m'mapupa, yitusitusi ya Ababiloni yalembedwe ni utoto wecejewu. Ŵanduwo ŵataŵile malamba myiwunu, ni kuwala nduŵila ku mtwe. Wosopewo ŵawonekaga mpela acakulungwa ŵa ngondo, soni ŵawonekaga mpela Ababiloni alukusyo ŵa ku Kalideya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.14+EZK.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.14",
              "EZK.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Piŵagambile kwawona jemanjajo, jwamkongwe jula jwakumbile, ni jwatumisye ŵamitenga kukwaŵilanga ku Babiloniya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo acalume ŵa ku Babiloniya ŵayice kwa jwalakwe ni gona najo. Ŵamsakesye ligongo lya yakusaka ya yilu yawo, ali amsakesye myoyo, jwamkongwejo nganiŵanonyela soni acalumewo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jwamkongwejo ŵatendaga ya lilama pakulanguka, soni ŵalosyaga ku yalo kwakwe ngatenda soni. Myoyo namŵenjile mpela munatendele ni mkulugwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo ŵapitilisye kutenda ya lilama ngalecesya, ni kumbucilaga ya lilama yiŵatendaga ndaŵi jiŵaliji lihule ku Iguputo pa ŵanace wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵasakaga maganja gigakwete yiŵalo yiyaliji yekulungwa mpela ya bulu, mtukuta wawo uwaliji mpela wa mahaci.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Myoyo m'mwe Oholiba mwasakaga soni kutenda yalilama mpela mumwatendelaga ku Iguputo mli mwali, kwele kuŵamkamulaga maŵele genu.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mlungu akumpa cilango Oholiba",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Sambano Une AMBUJE Mlungu nguti, M'mwe Oholiba, tinjigajimusya maganja genu gagakumnyalaya kuti galimbane ni m'mwejo. Tinjigaŵilanga kuti gayice kutyocela ku mbali syosope. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tinjaŵilanga ŵandu ŵa ku Babiloniya, wosope wa ku Kalideya, ŵa ku Pekodi, ŵa ku Showa, ŵa ku Kowa, pamo ni Asiliya wosope. Wosope ali acalume ŵakusalala, acibwanamkubwa, acakulungwa ŵakulongolela ngondo, asilikali, wosopewo ni ŵakwela mahaci. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Taciyika kutyocela kumpoto kukuputa ngondo ni mahaci ga ngondo ni yigeleta yejinji. Kwika soni likuga lyekulungwa lya ngondo lyakutyocela ku yilambo yosope. Tacimsyungulila ali awete yakulicinjilicisya ni yisoti ya ngondo. Tinjimpeleka m'mwejo kwa jemanjajo, ni tacimlamula mwakuya malamusi gawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tinjakunda kuti amtendele ngalwe ligongo lyakuti namtumbilile. Tacikata lupula lwenu ni mapikanilo genu ni kwawulaga ŵanace ŵenu. Elo, tacimsumula ŵanace ŵenu ŵacalume ni ŵacakongwe ni kwajoca moto ali cijumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tacipapulanya yakuwala yenu, ni kumsumula yakulisalalicisya yenu ya mtengo wapenani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo tinjilekasya yakunyalaya ni yacikululu yenu yele yimŵele mli mkuyitenda mli mkutama ku Iguputo. Myoyo ngasimkumbila soni yindu ya Iguputo kapena kuyikumbucila soni.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
